|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Financing / lease-to-own for driver-owners | Upfront cost, access to credit | Financier | Payback sensitivity (sec. 8), interview financing barrier |
| 2 | Battery-as-a-Service / battery swapping | Battery cost, charging time, resale value | Battery operator | Battery share of cost (sec. 8), charging barrier |
| 3 | Fleet / aggregator-led ownership with driver rental | Capital needs, maintenance, downtime | Fleet operator | Owner vs. renter split in interviews |
| 4 | OEM-backed buy-back & warranty assurance | Resale-value and reliability concerns | OEM | Resale / trust barriers in interviews |
